WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.350
Kimberly drives into the cornered Ryu.

2
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.150
Ryu guards the Drive Impact and suffers the recorded wall crush.

3
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.850
Crouching heavy punch links into Sprint launcher.

4
00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.750
The OD air grab catches the launch.

5
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.800
A second Sprint launcher extends the rebound.

6
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.350
Light Vagabond Edge finishes the juggle.

7
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:07.700
Ryu falls beside the wall.
